# Coverage directory used by tools like istanbul. Anchored to the repo root and
# to build outputs: an unanchored `coverage` also swallowed source directories
# named `coverage/` (it silently dropped the Zones blanches helpers from a commit).
/coverage
apps/*/coverage
packages/*/coverage
*.lcov

